/*!
\page page_stPhmdCluster StPhmdCluster

\brief Reconstructed cluster of adjacent pad cells in the STAR PHMD.

\section phmdCluster_overview Overview

StPhmdCluster represents a group of contiguous StPhmdHit cells sharing
energy from a common particle shower in one plane of the STAR Photon
Multiplicity Detector (2.3 < η < 3.9).  The centroid is expressed in
(η, φ) coordinates.  Two PID fields classify each cluster as a photon,
charged hadron, or other particle using energy-deposition shape and
track-matching criteria.

\section phmdCluster_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StPhmdCluster
\endcode

Stored in \c StPhmdClusterCollection attached to
\ref page_stPhmdDetector "StPhmdDetector".

\section phmdCluster_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Int_t | mModule | Supermodule number [0, 11]. |
| Int_t | mNumberOfCells | Number of constituent cells. |
| Float_t | mEta | η centroid. |
| Float_t | mPhi | φ centroid [rad]. |
| Float_t | mEnergy | Total energy deposit [GeV]. |
| Float_t | mSigma | RMS spatial spread. |
| Int_t | mPID | Track-matching particle ID. |
| Int_t | mEnergyPID | Energy-deposition particle ID. |
| Int_t | mMcPID | Monte Carlo truth particle ID. |
| StPtrVecPhmdHit | mHits | Constituent hits (non-owning). |

\section phmdCluster_methods Key Methods

- \c module(), \c numberOfCells() — cluster address and size.
- \c eta(), \c phi(), \c energy(), \c sigma() — cluster kinematics and shape.
- \c energyPid(), \c pid(), \c mcPid() — particle identification.
- \c hit(), \c addHit() — access constituent hits.
- \c set*() — corresponding setters.

\section phmdCluster_seealso See Also

\ref page_stPhmdHit "StPhmdHit",
\ref page_stPhmdDetector "StPhmdDetector",
\ref page_stPhmdModule "StPhmdModule"
*/
